  "organization": "ScaleDock",
  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Covers the Cedar policy language in three version lines: Cedar 4.x (current, language 4.5 as implemented by SDK v4.13.0) and the legacy Cedar 3.x and 2.x lines, with what changed in each language version and the upgrades from 2.x to 3.x and 3.x to 4.x. Covers policy structure with effect, scope and conditions, annotations, operators, policy templates, the Cedar and JSON schema formats, entity and context JSON, PARC authorization requests, the authorization algorithm (default deny, forbid overrides permit, skip on error), validation checks and their limits, and security practices. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out versions, policies, schemas and entities, and evaluation and validation.",
